    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FitzGerald’s are delighted to offer this site for sale by Private Treaty. An excellent opportunity to acquire a superb residential site extending to approximately 1 acres (0.4 hectares). \r\nThis property is located at Wallslough, just a short drive from Danesfort and Kilkenny City. Ideally positioned within easy access to the M9 Dublin / Waterford motorway at Exit 9 and within a 5-minute drive of Kilkenny City, with all amenities including shops, both primary and secondary schools, churches, recreational facilities including Kilkenny Rugby Club, Danesfort GAA club etc. \r\nThis attractive site offers the perfect setting to build your dream home in a peaceful countryside location while enjoying the convenience of nearby amenities, schools, and transport links. The generous site size provides ample space for a substantial family residence with gardens and outdoor living areas.\r\nThe site combines rural charm with excellent accessibility, making it an ideal choice for those seeking to create their forever home in a desirable location.\r\nThe property was previously granted planning permission in the owner’s name under Planning Reference No. 2460335, demonstrating its suitability for residential development.\r\nThe site is being offered for sale subject to planning permission.\r\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, give us a call on 056 777 0888.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nElectricity, mains water and telecoms available close by."
      }
